E3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"American (New), Breakfast & Brunch, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"American (New), Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"98mYebjHN_VXZapVm8Nmqg","review_id":"ar2Bc96dNOXZtKoygJNxew","date":"2019-07-19T04:02:04","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9376012682914734,"text_excerpt":"Love SWEGS! This place is soo delicious and healthy! There's a food option for almost any diet type, and what's great is you can sit down to have a hot meal or you can take a refrigerated meal to go! The prices are on par considering the quality of what you're getting --fresh, whole foods which are properly seasoned while still remaining \"healthy\". The only thing I've had that I wasn't over the moon about was the tenderloin steak salad because the meat was too tough for my liking. Hopefully they've improved that recipe over the years. Overall, I think this is the perfect lunch spot or place to go when you want to grab a few options to throw in the freeze and save for meal prep for later i..."},{"business_id":"98mYebjHN_VXZapVm8Nmqg","review_id":"sUp2ExhaDcpYXrEqAV7ujg","date":"2017-08-08T16:22:21","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9255592823028564,"text_excerpt":"This is a really great place for some great food fast and healthy, or healthier than most other places! I absolutely love their salads and paninis. Their salads are kind of pricey but you do get a very full meal. The only reason I gave 4 stars is for the price point. Their new menu they started yesterday looks great too! I definitely want to try the shrimp and grits. It looked great at the table next to us, hehe."},{"business_id":"98mYebjHN_VXZapVm8Nmqg","review_id":"QYxNMqraQ_ctB0xYgxV7JA","date":"2018-02-21T19:03:24","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9252261519432068,"text_excerpt":"Swegs gets the job done if you're looking for quick, healthy, and calorie-conscious food. I love any restaurant that shows the calories-per-dish on their menu. This is very much a quick, casual meal place, or (for me) a takeout place. The turkey meatballs and zoodles is my favorite to order. Service has always been quick and very polite. There are also pre-made meals int he case if you'd like to stock up at home."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"98mYebjHN_VXZapVm8Nmqg","photo_id":"n3uPk45LRXa_fCEuqcJ12A","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/n3uPk45LRXa_fCEuqcJ12A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8433784246444702},{"business_id":"98mYebjHN_VXZapVm8Nmqg","photo_id":"X_yy0i3d6xUeBt-3PvAe-Q","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/X_yy0i3d6xUeBt-3PvAe-Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8167087435722351},{"business_id":"98mYebjHN_VXZapVm8Nmqg","photo_id":"ppL2tcXTAbWNjgd4tNJFQA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/ppL2tcXTAbWNjgd4tNJFQA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8108904361724854},{"business_id":"98mYebjHN_VXZapVm8Nmqg","photo_id":"fmoyZJGY8sCPm81U